--- 1. GET entre orígenes, la API sin cabeceras CORS
JS recibió      : {"ok":false,"error":"TypeError: Failed to fetch"}
Consola         : Access to fetch at 'http://127.0.0.1:18638/v0/pedidos/42' from origin 'http://127.0.0.1:18637' has been blocked by CORS policy: No 'Access-Control-Allow-Origin' header is present on the requested resource.
La API vio      : GET /v0/pedidos/42  origin=http://127.0.0.1:18637  sec_fetch_site=same-site
--- 2. La API agrega Access-Control-Allow-Origin
JS recibió      : {"ok":true,"estado":200,"cuerpo":{"id":42,"cliente":"Ferretería Norte","estado":"en ruta"}}

--- 3. PUT con Authorization y JSON: la API contesta mal el preflight
JS recibió      : {"ok":false,"error":"TypeError: Failed to fetch"}
Consola         : ...blocked by CORS policy: Response to preflight request doesn't pass access control check: No 'Access-Control-Allow-Origin' header is present on the requested resource.
La API vio      : [OPTIONS /v2/pedidos/42  acr_method=PUT  acr_headers=authorization,content-type]
--- 4. Misma llamada, preflight bien contestado (dos veces seguidas)
1.ª vez         : {"ok":true,"estado":200,"cuerpo":{"ok":true,"metodo":"PUT"}}
2.ª vez         : {"ok":true,"estado":200,"cuerpo":{"ok":true,"metodo":"PUT"}}
La API vio      : [OPTIONS, PUT, PUT]

sin credentials    : {"ok":true,"estado":200,"texto":"{\"id\":1,\"cookie\":false}"}
credentials include: {"ok":true,"estado":200,"texto":"{\"id\":1,\"cookie\":true}"}
--- credenciales con Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
{"ok":false,"error":"Failed to fetch"}
Consola: Access to fetch at 'http://127.0.0.1:18638/c0/yo' from origin 'http://127.0.0.1:18637' has been blocked by CORS policy: The value of the 'Access-Control-Allow-Origin' header in the response must not be the wildcard '*' when the request's credentials mode is 'include'.
